{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40005,"sections":[{"id":"script-20005","name":"原始脚本 20005","scripts":[20005],"start":0,"count":46}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:1","scriptId":20005,"text":"当众人都开始在模拟世界中执行任务的时候，另一股势力已经悄悄进入了这个模拟世界。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:2","scriptId":20005,"text":"“就是这里了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":62,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:3","scriptId":20005,"text":"三个身影降落在模拟世界的地图之上。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":62,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:4","scriptId":20005,"text":"“这里是钢舞姬新建立的模拟世界，不过安全系统做得极差，所以很轻松得就潜入进来了。那个……埃普西隆，你为什么也要跟来？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":62,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":48,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:5","scriptId":20005,"text":"“兰布达说有好玩的，我就跟来了～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":62,"right":48,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:6","scriptId":20005,"text":"“算了……，德尔塔，不要计较埃普西隆的事情，在这里可能还用得到她。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":48,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:7","scriptId":20005,"text":"“好吧……那我先制作一点数化原核体当探路先锋吧。毕竟除了我，你们两个的能力在这个模拟世界中并不管用。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:8","scriptId":20005,"text":"“好的，就这样吧，和钢舞姬们玩玩，适当的收集一些战斗数据。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:9","scriptId":20005,"text":"“恩～～～～感觉良好，电子世界比现实世界要清爽干净。虽然制作水平一般般，不过还算舒适，作为休息放松的地方还不错。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:10","scriptId":20005,"text":"兰布达伸了个懒腰。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:11","scriptId":20005,"text":"“只帮你这一次，如果让奥米克戎发现了，我就说你硬逼我的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:12","scriptId":20005,"text":"“恩，谢谢……我偶尔也会不想做研究，休息整顿。正好发现有这种虚拟世界的波长，结果还是人类开发的，就直接来看一下了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:13","scriptId":20005,"text":"“你高兴就好……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:14","scriptId":20005,"text":"（毕竟是兰布达的请求，很少见到她会这样拜托别人，就当卖个顺水人情，以后说不定还能请她开发点高级设备给我。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":50,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:15","scriptId":20005,"text":"“你们还没好吗？那我先出去逛逛咯～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":50,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:16","scriptId":20005,"text":"说完，埃普西隆带着一批原核体就先一溜烟得跑了……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":50,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:18","scriptId":20005,"text":"撇开擅自跑开的埃普西隆，根据兰布达的指示，德尔塔开始侦测并窃取这个模拟世界的数据。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:19","scriptId":20005,"text":"不过好景不长，很快她们就意识到自己被发现了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:20","scriptId":20005,"text":"“我们好像已经被发现了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":null,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:21","scriptId":20005,"text":"“哦？看来人类那边还是有些能耐的嘛，那接下来呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:22","scriptId":20005,"text":"“我已经看到有钢舞姬朝我们这边来了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:23","scriptId":20005,"text":"“钢舞姬？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:24","scriptId":20005,"text":"“只不过是些防御数据罢了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:25","scriptId":20005,"text":"一番短兵交接之后……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:26","scriptId":20005,"text":"毕竟只是些防御数据，很快就被兰布达和德尔塔摆平了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:27","scriptId":20005,"text":"“那么我们继续吧，反正都已经被发现了，从偷取数据转为强夺数据而已。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:28","scriptId":20005,"text":"“不过这样的话，应该会有更多的防御数据朝我们攻过来的吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:29","scriptId":20005,"text":"“过来的话，你把她们清理掉不就行了吗，反正闲着也是闲着。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:30","scriptId":20005,"text":"“哦～对了，还有个办法，刚才那些钢舞姬的数据我重组一下让她们当我的卫兵～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:31","scriptId":20005,"text":"“那我就暂时离开这里，分成两队的话，更容易迷惑对方，我会尽量吸引的，原核体都给我吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":62,"speaker":"德尔塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:32","scriptId":20005,"text":"“好的，那么我这边完工以后就会把你和埃普西隆直接转移出模拟世界。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:33","scriptId":20005,"text":"“就这么办。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:34","scriptId":20005,"text":"另一方面，清理掉了战车兽，正在等待波西娅下一步的指示。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":56,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:35","scriptId":20005,"text":"“刚才有看到别的钢舞姬，除了我们三个小队以外还有别的钢舞姬吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":62,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:36","scriptId":20005,"text":"“应该没有吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:37","scriptId":20005,"text":"“难道是模拟世界的数据？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":572,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:38","scriptId":20005,"text":"“没错，是这里的防御数据，因为正有其他的不明数据入侵，并且还反噬了一部分我的防御数据……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":572,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":577,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:39","scriptId":20005,"text":"“呜啊！波西娅博士不要这么吓人好吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":577,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:40","scriptId":20005,"text":"波西娅犹如从空气中诞生的一般，突然出现在奈特莉的背后。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":577,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:41","scriptId":20005,"text":"“啊哈哈，不好意思～只不过这样出现挺带感的，现实中可体验不了啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":577,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:42","scriptId":20005,"text":"“等等，有一批被反噬的数据朝我们这边来了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":577,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:43","scriptId":20005,"text":"看到远方有一些钢舞姬朝这边冲了过来……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":577,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:44","scriptId":20005,"text":"“这……还要对付钢舞姬吗……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:45","scriptId":20005,"text":"“没啥啦～不过是采集来的样本数据，很好对付的啦～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:46","scriptId":20005,"text":"“好吧……全队准备！火炮瞄准前方进军的钢舞姬。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":608,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":593,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20005:20005:47","scriptId":20005,"text":"“了解！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-16.webp","left":4,"right":593,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
